{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49046","headline":"永嘉经谢公石门山作 · 郭密之","name":"永嘉经谢公石门山作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绵境经耳目，未尝旷跻登。\n一窥石门险，再涤心神懵。\n洞壑閟金涧，欹崖盘石楞。\n阴潭下羃羃，秀岭上层层。\n千丈瀑流蹇，半溪风雨絚。\n兴余志每惬，心远道自弘。\n乘轺广储峙，只命媿才能。\n辍櫂周气象，扪条历骞崩。\n忽如生羽翼，怳若将起腾。\n谢客今已矣，我来谁与朋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭密之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}